      56.66,
      118.64,
      514.15,
      172.25
    ],
    "text": "Bulletin No: 05 MSW /26/11/01/01 COLOR: Red Warning for strong winds and rough seas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      5.039999961853027,
      9.960000038146973,
      12.0,
      15.960000038146973
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      56.66,
      172.82,
      391.1,
      217.58
    ],
    "text": "Issued by the Natural Hazards Early Warning Centre Issued at 12.30 p.m. 01 November 2026, valid for the next 24 hours.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599999785423279,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      141.38,
      220.61,
      471.39,
      234.65
    ],
    "text": "For Multi-day boats in the Bay of Bengal deep sea areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      56.66,
      236.24,
      555.67,
      301.85
    ],
    "text": "Take Action! The Depression over the Southeast Bay of Bengal has now intensified into a Deep Depression at 05.30 a.m. on 01 November 2026, the system was located near latitude 11.5\u00b0N and longitude 86.4\u00b0E.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.960000038146973,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      56.66,
      318.41,
      555.65,
      374.33
    ],
    "text": "The system is very likely to move west-northwestwards and intensify into a Cyclone over the Southeast and adjoining west-central Bay of Bengal around 11.30 a.m. on 01 November 2026. Continuing to move west-northwestwards, it is very likely to intensify further into a Severe Cyclonic Storm and cross Andra Pradesh coast by 05.30 a.m. on 03 November 2026.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      56.66,
      391.01,
      555.6,
      436.73
    ],
    "text": "Wind speeds in the sea areas marked under the \u201cWarning\u201d category in the map below, may increase to (70-80) kmph at times, heavy thundershowers can occur, and these sea areas will become very rough.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      56.66,
      449.26,
      555.6,
      499.51
    ],
    "text": "Therefore, Naval and fishing communities are warned not to venture to the deep-sea areas bounded by 10N-15N and 80E-90E until further notice. Further, Naval and fishing communities operating in those sea areas are advised to move to safe areas.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      2.0399999618530273,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      56.66,
      841.92,
      553.54,
      921.36
    ],
    "text": "Naval and fishing communities engaging the activities over this sea area are advised to be vigilant and be attentive to the future forecasts and bulletins issued by the department of meteorology in this regards.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  }
]